<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/22/eng@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 132 of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) For the purposes of this section, arrangements made with a view to affording relief from double taxation include any arrangements which modify the effect of arrangements so made.”. Amendment of section 132b"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/22/eng@> .
