<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/22/eng@/~cl_8> <https://schema.org/text> "Section 132b of the principal Act is amended by inserting after subsection (1) the following subsection: “(1a) Where any arrangements have effect by virtue of this section, section 138 shall not prevent the disclosure to a duly authorized servant or agent of the government with which the arrangements have been made of such information as is required to be disclosed under the arrangements.”. New section 132c"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2018/22/eng@> .
